URL: https://gfcafe.preview.resto.cloud/admin/stock-manager#overview
Path: Sidebar -> Catalog -> Stock Manager -> "Обзор" tab -> Select a category (e.g., "Добавки")
Description: Controls for individual products. Includes status toggle, visibility toggle, and stock adjustment buttons (+/-, unlimited).

Annotation:
